      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Evidence is emerging for an important role for the CC chemokines, particularly the eotaxins, in the pathogenesis of asthmatic and allergic inflammation. This article reviews the evidence for this involvement and describes new approaches to therapeutics that are evolving as a result."},
